WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.540
Two new roots.

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:03.380
Lev means lift.

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:05.670
Think of an elevator lifting you up.

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:07.730
Sist means stand.

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:10.740
When you resist, you stand against something.

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:13.440
Every word today is lifting or standing.

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:15.730
Ask which one, then sew the patch.
